  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "ce31c2e3-0e24-41af-8b21-8d01648732cf",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol a uma tarefa já terminada no dia.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2fbb6738-d91e-436b-aff4-4e38e977b33f",
          "textContent": "<p>Em uma atualização do dia, esta frase mostra uma tarefa que já ficou pronta.</p><p><strong>Hoy ya he enviado el correo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hoje eu já enviei o e-mail.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b20125b58aa44464a8c21abdb39a91b1_l04-office-update-completed-tasks.png?Expires=1794099562&Signature=aSHKHgZGV07iTugSq5gsVv9SxPHkZUJwXCTwoaPe~7QWPL5SeDyNHLdvCrw0qm1SxuVU9kCtgP~EJzwKYkwCa8jJhVDwjt5EEnHgqyjYoyGyWVMuRBMWhK0vrati74baUAhgUNc1BAIasJYus338K4BzxiaYqmX7haBKzmESaY6PWcMI8oy~eTP3wjaDqunRdiBJ96bt~oiPYy3LTGwzL~-QXVvU1iOya~sUeBZUYoRYNTyktj7sJGYHPCYXLyb0QMqbJd2op~OFpq-AO6-4MyBZ8p6UT70gTnh-PqT1ceejGKCTHxRWvNhg2jPC1Vu3xV455NjvnEZQKgnFZhZAew__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a8047d7c506441b6bcc00c296ea9cbd8_l04b01-hoy-ya-he-enviado-el-correo.mp3?Expires=1794099562&Signature=NbWi0FoocLk~7jPPQFEM6l4CPLsDmblxw3M4nG0RbPjBA7VKQybph8uKzQMxtZeztkERjF1Qn6g52aNiuEeGmLWEjYDWSEDVEcJmgWrvSM6KfUOzTqRFx4CnL8-rXNhTjNuctErwLfzseY02pdSKpajk~oF8TkSzBZK-wEMz871EQfhBj6Wr88G7lFb42Cx0e1PXJFar6gzNWgRxHKmm-WhLrShZTSK7zuMHF~jh0uDI0cuUL5t3ytOrFIXIacrizHYgrmOwYoU4fT~6UKKawvhsaHoa7A70GbZrV7Ai6e1t4JG-RMZXsHVhJVTd4LalpDkCS~PgKWwZUCyju77ISQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
